      "content": "Thanks. This is a good start, pretty concise. I noticed the sentiment score for this one was a bit lower than I expected for a major piece of legislation—it's sitting around 0.45. \n\nI know I said not to worry about it, but looking at your summary, it feels like the \"cons\" are a bit blunt. Could you expand the \"pros\" section a bit more? Specifically, I want more detail on how the revenue generation and the international leadership aspects actually work to support the transition. I need the summary to feel more comprehensive so the briefing has more substance.",
